# Call of Fire at level 10.
# - Orcs, Trolls and Tauren: one of four letters (2983 Swart in Razor Hill,
#   1522 Searn Firewarder in Orgrimmar, 2984 Narm Skychaser in Bloodhoof
#   Village, 1523 Xanis Flameweaver in Thunder Bluff; they exclude one
#   another) -> Kranal Fiss north of the Crossroads (1524: the Torch of the
#   Dormant Flame) -> Telf Joolam on the mountain across the river in Durotar
#   (1525: Fire Tar and a Reagent Pouch) -> the Fire Sapta and the Minor
#   Manifestation of Fire on Telf's peak (1526, the Brazier of the Dormant
#   Flame) -> the lit Torch of Eternal Flame back to Kranal (1527).
# - Skyborne: Forever's own chain on Zephras Isle (97243-97257): Sessaria
#   Skystride in Valanaar (or Aarnor Galestrike) -> Olariaan Swiftburn at the
#   Shrine of Flames -> Skypriest Faladiel's heart -> Kuramaa's mask -> the
#   timed ritual run with the Eternal Flame back to Valanaar. Forever's server
#   race mask takes Skyborne off the Barrens letters (1522, 1523, 1524, 2983,
#   2984; corrections/quests.json).
# A Skyborne who reaches 10 off the isle gets Call of Fire 98517 (Forever's
# server answer: "report to Sessaria Skystride or Aarnor Galestrike ... the
# skycutter that docks in Mulgore at Skywatcher Plateau"); no data names its
# giver, so it is a tip on the first Skyborne step, not a goal.
# Rewards: the Fire Totem and Forever's Totem of Charged Flames (1527 and
# 97257, quests.json; the Forever page of 97257 lists Searing Totem too).
# Drops, levels and timers from Forever's quest notes: Fire Tar 75% from the
# four Razormane casters (respawn 4 min 35 s), Reagent Pouch 75% from the
# seven Burning Blade Cultists (5 min); the Minor Manifestation of Fire is
# level 12, immune to fire, single spawn (3 min), Glowing Ember every kill;
# 97257 runs on a six-minute timer.
# Fire Sapta 1464 (Telf) replaces a lost sapta while 1526 is open (PrevQuestID
# -1526 in the TDB: "while on quest").
# The leveling guides carry these inline (orc-troll/01-durotar and
# 02-the-barrens, tauren/01-mulgore and horde/02-the-barrens,
# horde/skyborne/01-zephras-isle): this guide does the chain in one go.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orcs and Trolls

step Swart
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Durotar
  tip At 10 Swart, the shaman trainer on the east side of Razor Hill, sends you to Kranal Fiss in the Barrens. Already carry Searn Firewarder's letter from Orgrimmar? It goes to Kranal too: skip Swart.
  level 10
  accept 2983 optional                        -- Swart, Razor Hill

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tauren

step Narm Skychaser
  only Tauren
  zone Mulgore
  tip At 10 Narm Skychaser, the shaman trainer in Bloodhoof Village, sends you to Kranal Fiss in the Barrens. Already carry Xanis Flameweaver's letter from Thunder Bluff? It goes to Kranal too: skip Narm.
  level 10
  accept 2984 optional                        -- Narm Skychaser, Bloodhoof Village

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Kranal Fiss and Telf Joolam

step Kranal Fiss
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  zone The Barrens
  tip Kranal Fiss is not in the Crossroads: take the road north from the Crossroads and fork east towards Durotar; past Grol'dom Farm he paces by a tall tower east of the road (from Durotar: over the Southfury bridge, past Far Watch Post). If you reach Ashenvale you went too far.
  goto 56.0,19.9 "Kranal Fiss"

step
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  when onquest 2983
  turnin 2983                                 -- Kranal Fiss: Swart's letter

step
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  when onquest 1522
  turnin 1522                                 -- Kranal Fiss: Searn Firewarder's letter

step
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  when onquest 2984
  turnin 2984                                 -- Kranal Fiss: Narm Skychaser's letter

step
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  when onquest 1523
  turnin 1523                                 -- Kranal Fiss: Xanis Flameweaver's letter

step Kranal Fiss
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  tip Kranal hands you the Torch of the Dormant Flame: keep it until the end of the chain.
  accept 1524

step Telf Joolam
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  zone Durotar
  tip Back east over the bridge, then south along the Durotar bank of the river to where the mountains meet the water. The trail up starts at the foot of the mountain beside a small dark stone carved with symbols, near the quilboar camp; it is narrow, and a slip costs fall damage. Telf Joolam keeps the shrine at the top.
  turnin 1524                                 -- Telf Joolam
  accept 1525

step Fire Tar
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  zone The Barrens
  tip The Razormane casters north-east of the Crossroads drop the Fire Tar three times in four: Water Seekers and Thornweavers (level 10-11), Geomancers (level 12-13, they throw Fireballs and run for help when hurt) and Mystics (level 13-14, they heal themselves at low health). Pull them one at a time.
  collect 5026 quest 1525.1                   -- Fire Tar

step Reagent Pouch
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  zone Durotar
  tip The Burning Blade Cultists (level 10-11, they call imps and cast Immolate) live deep in Dustwind Cave north of Razor Hill: climb the ramp just north-east of town and stay on the high ground above the ravines. The orcs at the cave mouth are not cultists; the cultists are further in, off to the left. Three kills in four drop a pouch. Skull Rock by Orgrimmar is the wrong cave.
  collect 6652 quest 1525.2                   -- Reagent Pouch

step Telf Joolam
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  tip Back up the trail to Telf. He makes the Fire Sapta from the tar and the pouch and hands it to you with the torch: keep both.
  turnin 1525                                 -- Telf Joolam
  accept 1526

step Lost the Fire Sapta?
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  when onquest 1526
  when !has 6636
  tip Only if the Fire Sapta is gone from your bags: Telf gives you another.
  accept 1464
  turnin 1464                                 -- Telf Joolam: a new Fire Sapta

step The Minor Manifestation of Fire
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  tip Drink the Fire Sapta beside the Shaman Shrine, the big grey stone just below the summit, then climb to the plateau. Of the fire elementals there only the one in the middle can be attacked: it is level 12, immune to fire and grows stronger the longer the fight lasts, so open at once with Rockbiter Weapon and Earth Shock and leave the others alone. Its Glowing Ember drops every time.
  use 6636 @38.1,58.5                         -- Fire Sapta, beside the Shaman Shrine
  collect 6655 quest 1526.1                   -- Glowing Ember: Minor Manifestation of Fire

step The Brazier of the Dormant Flame
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  tip Click the Brazier of the Dormant Flame on the plateau with the torch in your bags to place the ember, then click it a second time: the next quest does not open by itself. It gives you the lit Torch of Eternal Flame.
  turnin 1526                                 -- Brazier of the Dormant Flame
  accept 1527

step Kranal Fiss
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  zone The Barrens
  tip Down the trail, back over the bridge to Kranal Fiss by his tower. Keep the Fire Totem in your bags for good: every fire totem needs it.
  turnin 1527 reward 5176 263412              -- Kranal Fiss: Searing Totem, your Fire Totem and the Totem of Charged Flames

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Skyborne: Zephras Isle

step Sessaria Skystride
  only Skyborne
  zone Zephras Isle
  tip At 10 Sessaria Skystride, the shaman trainer beside Ayessa Dawnsinger in Valanaar, hands you the Torch of the Dormant Flame (Aarnor Galestrike offers the same quest). Already left the isle? A Call of Fire sends you back to them: take the skycutter from the cliffs south of Skywatcher Plateau, north of Thunder Bluff. Learn Flame Shock from her now: Kuramaa, later in the chain, only takes fire damage.
  level 10
  accept 97243                                -- Sessaria Skystride
  train class

step Olariaan Swiftburn
  only Skyborne
  tip The Shrine of Flames hides on the island's outer rim south-west of Valanaar, just south-east of Windfield Orchard: Olariaan Swiftburn keeps it.
  turnin 97243                                -- Olariaan Swiftburn
  accept 97244

step Skypriest Faladiel
  only Skyborne
  tip Skypriest Faladiel (level 10, a turncoat Windshaper with a single spawn) holds the farm north-east past Valanaar, just south of the Shrine of Akir, on the hill west of the falls north of the East Pylon Watchtower. Kill him and take his heart.
  collect 277267 quest 97244.1                -- Faladiel's Heart

step Olariaan Swiftburn
  only Skyborne
  tip Back to Olariaan at the Shrine of Flames.
  turnin 97244                                -- Olariaan Swiftburn
  accept 97245

step Kuramaa
  only Skyborne
  tip Kuramaa's Stump is the twisted stump on the hilltop by the Shen'dar Highlands Anchor Pylon, west of Valanaar, in the hills south of the Windsong Crawlers' lakes. Knock on it to call Kuramaa (level 10). The spirit shrugs off most magic: only fire hurts it, so keep Flame Shock on it. Take its wooden mask.
  interact 660848                             -- Kuramaa's Stump: knock on the bark
  collect 277269 quest 97245.1                -- Kuramaa's Mask

step The Eternal Flame
  only Skyborne
  tip Back to Olariaan. Accept the last quest, then wait by the Brazier of Offering while he performs the ritual; when the fire spirits light the Eternal Flame, hold the torch to it. From then you have six minutes: carry the flame straight to the Brazier of Eternal Flame beside Sessaria in Valanaar, with no detours or fights. Timer out? Abandon the quest and take it again from Olariaan.
  turnin 97245                                -- Olariaan Swiftburn
  accept 97257
  goto 51.2,85.9 "Brazier of Offering"
  complete 97257 @58.4,78.8                   -- the ritual, then the Brazier of Eternal Flame in Valanaar

step Sessaria Skystride
  only Skyborne
  tip Keep the Fire Totem in your bags for good: every fire totem needs it.
  turnin 97257 reward 5176 263412             -- Sessaria Skystride: Searing Totem, your Fire Totem and the Totem of Charged Flames
